const snapshot = state => {const result=structuredClone(state);const legacy=[['number',38],['title',240],['artist',150],['album',160],['year',65],['genre',100],['duration',80],['rating',96]].map(([key,width])=>({key,width,visible:true,fixed:false}));result.settings={artistGrouping:'folder',defaultSort:'folder',lastView:'albums',defaultView:'albums',albumView:'list',theme:'sage',accentColor:'',backgroundHue:220,backgroundSaturation:12,backgroundBrightness:11,sidebarWidth:176,artistWidth:220,sidebarLocked:false,artistLocked:false,seekHeightLocked:false,waveformStyle:'bars',trackNumberFormat:'number',libraryOpening:'none',columnsByView:Object.fromEntries(['tracks','playlists','albums'].map(k=>[k,legacy.map(c=>({...c}))])),...result.settings};if(!state.settings?.lastView)result.settings.lastView=state.settings?.defaultView==='tracks'?'tracks':state.settings?.albumView==='covers'?'covers':'albums';result.tracks=result.tracks.map(t=>({...t,folderKey:t.folderKey||t.artist,folderArtist:t.folderArtist||t.artist}));return result;};
const flush = () => new Promise(resolve => setImmediate(resolve));
test('library and playlist creation update sidebar and selected collection through the bridge', async () => {
 const dom=new JSDOM(html,{runScripts:'outside-only'}), w=dom.window, d=w.document;
 Object.assign(w,{createDuplicatesDialog},{createSettingsHelp,createDuplicatesDialog},core,browse,interactions,{structuredClone},{designDefaults,appearanceDefaults},{createSettingsWrites},{createTagEditor,createPlaylistEditor,createLastfmSettings},{createDialogCoordinator,createSettingsTabs},{createBrowseSelection},{createPlaybackQueue},{createWindowPresentation,createAudioOutputSettings,mountVirtualTracks},{createIcons,normalizeMenu,shortcutDefaults,createQueueViewCache,queuePage},{createNameDialog,ListenTracker,waveformPath});
 for(const dialog of d.querySelectorAll('dialog')){dialog.showModal=()=>dialog.setAttribute('open','');dialog.close=()=>{dialog.removeAttribute('open');dialog.dispatchEvent(new w.Event('close'));};}
 let state={libraries:[],tracks:[],playlists:[]}, calls=[],ready=false;
 w.localtone={uiReady:()=>{assert.equal(d.documentElement.hasAttribute('data-booting'),false);assert.ok(d.querySelector('#open-settings svg'));ready=true;},load:async()=>{assert.equal(d.documentElement.hasAttribute('data-booting'),true);return snapshot(state);},onProgress:()=>{},
  addLibrary:async name=>{calls.push(['library',name]);state.libraries.push({id:'l',name});return {state:snapshot(state)};},
  playlist:async action=>{calls.push(['playlist',action.name]);state.playlists.push({id:'p',name:action.name,trackIds:[]});return snapshot(state);}};
 try {
  w.localtone.settings??=async patch=>patch;await w.eval(`(async()=>{${source}\n})()`);
  assert.equal(ready,true);
  d.getElementById('add-playlist').click();d.getElementById('playlist-name').value='Night';
  d.getElementById('playlist-settings-form').dispatchEvent(new w.Event('submit',{bubbles:true,cancelable:true}));await flush();
  assert.equal(d.getElementById('title').textContent,'Night');assert.equal(d.querySelector('#playlists button').textContent,'Night');
  d.getElementById('add-library').click();d.getElementById('name-input').value='Records';d.getElementById('name-save').click();await flush();
  assert.equal(d.getElementById('title').textContent,'Records');assert.equal(d.querySelector('#libraries button').textContent,'Records');
  assert.deepEqual(calls,[['playlist','Night'],['library','Records']]);
  assert.equal(d.getElementById('add-library').disabled,false);
 } finally {w.close();}
});
